    "reviews": "\u201cA Long Way Home has all the hallmarks for an indie sleeper hit\u201d<br>Pocket Gamer<br><br>\u201cIf you\u2019re up for patient, thoughtful gameplay that makes for an evocative experience, you should give A Long Way Home a shot.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Touch Arcade<br><br>\u201cOnly a handful of games for the iPad can produce an emotional response, as A Long Way Home did for me. I hope it can do the same for you.\u201d<br>Appolicious<br>",
